# r1106cbp (rerun of r1106cbo) single boot: chain + ADD="Quark-*.jar,AutoRegLib-*.jar", group A (SQ-CBO-40)
## SQ-CBO-40 | chain + Quark-*.jar,AutoRegLib-*.jar
bootexpect \[creativebrewing\] members: \[vinery, brewinandchewin\]$
bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory|Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|creativebrewing.*(NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException)|Encountered an unexpected exception
shell ! grep -nE "ReferenceError|TypeError|EvaluatorException|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
> cbo all
waitlog \[cbo\] done 30
expect effects leaks 0$
reject \[cbo\] leak 
reject \[cbo\] leak .*echo_
expect mods loaded 1 of 24: quark$
> zq potion quark:resilience minecraft:redstone,minecraft:glowstone_dust
sleep 3
expect resilience \+ minecraft:redstone -> nothing
expect resilience \+ minecraft:glowstone_dust -> nothing
> forceload add 0 0
sleep 1
> kill @e[tag=cbo]
> summon minecraft:iron_golem 0 -60 5 {Tags:["cbo"],NoAI:1b}
sleep 1
> effect give @e[tag=cbo] quark:resilience 60 0
sleep 1
> data get entity @e[tag=cbo,limit=1] ActiveEffects
sleep 2
> kill @e[tag=cbo]
reject Exception
look record whether Resilience stayed or was dropped (remap target absent)
